      <tr> 
       <td colspan="2" width="215"> <span style="width:215px;font-size:10pt;">1. 제목</span> </td> 
       <td width="381"> <span class="xforms_input" style="width:381px;font-size:10pt;">바이오의약품 위탁생산계약 의향서 체결</span> </td> 
      </tr> 
      <tr> 
       <td colspan="2" width="215"> <span style="width:215px;font-size:10pt;">2. 주요내용</span> </td> 
       <td width="381"> <span class="xforms_input" style="width:381px;font-size:10pt;">1) 계약 상대방 : 유럽 소재 제약사 <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java">2) 계약 금액 : 91,369,732,137원 <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java">3) 의향서 체결일자 : 2021.10.30 <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java">4) 계약기간 : 2021.10.30 ~ 2024.10.31</span> </td> 
